<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss unemployment rate rises to 4.6 pct in Sept.</title>
<headline>Swiss unemployment rate rises to 4.6 pct in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's unemployment rate stood at 4.6 percent at the end of September, up from 4.5 percent in August, the Swiss Federal Office of Trade, Industry and Labour said.</p>
<p>				   Sept 1996   August 1996  Sept 1995</p>
<p> Pct workforce unemployed    4.6 pct	4.5 pct     4.0 pct</p>
<p> Number of jobless	     166,409     163,705	143,458</p>
<p> Job vacancies		     5,224	 5,850	  5,410</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
